OL,3,GNEWSAPark tree collapse caused by
OL,4,Afungal infection
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Eloise Waldon-Day said she
OL,7,Fwas "really saddened" by the loss of
OL,8,Fthe mature oak, describing it as "an
OL,9,Femotive loss for local people".
OL,11,F"We're investigating what caused the
OL,12,Ftree to fall. We are strongly committed
OL,13,Fto protecting trees in Southwark for
OL,14,Fthe benefit of everyone," she said.
